        "payload": "tree 6ed9d62f564d1e455445cf9f0202ae6b190cf106\nparent 363d9e9d38154b7dced1767e996f8f18f391fcff\nauthor Jorge Espada <jorge@esprim.io> 1793361406 -0300\ncommitter Jorge Espada <jorge@esprim.io> 1793361406 -0300\n\nguix: map the whole DISTSRC in -fdebug-prefix-map\n\nGenerated sources (e.g. capnp proxies) live in the build tree, outside\n${DISTSRC}/src, so their debug paths kept the absolute /distsrc-base\nprefix. Map ${DISTSRC} instead so every source path is relative.\n\nFixes #34414.\n",
